{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Chained is a co-op souls-lite adventure where coordination is as vital as skill. Confront your brutal, monster-fied sins, co-navigate treacherous platforms, and endure purgatory with you and your partner eternally bound by the Soul Chain.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remember - one mistake may lead you both to your doom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re both Soul Chain-bound! </strong>Use it (and mind its physics) to control battles in creative ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrupt enemy attacks at the perfect moment; Coil up threats and punish them with chain magic; Clothesline mobs by pulling tight and moving as one; Yank your partner to safety\u2026 or doom (usually doom).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every swing counts. Every dodge matters. Combat is deliberate, weighty, and unforgiving - but fair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read patterns, commit to your moves, and fight like a unit. The chain adds an extra layer of risk: mistime a roll, drift too far, or fail to call out an attack\u2026 and you both pay the price. ROLL TOGETHER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only way out is through.</strong> Jump over devious platforming challenges where one bad leap can drag both of you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chain doesn\u2019t just test your timing - it tests your trust. Learn the rhythm, communicate, and embrace the tether\u2026 or prepare for the blame when you both hit the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal trials stand between you and redemption - each one a towering embodiment of your sins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These boss encounters demand true cooperation: manage distance, control the chain, and strike in unison. One mistake can snap your momentum and send you both back to suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo's not chaotic enough?</strong> Throw up to four players into purgatory and watch strategy unravel into glorious madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Coordination becomes a comedy of errors, clutch saves become legendary, and blame becomes a second language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544130?t=1769840140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/8977973196ed41b22844d3170e64d6bb9b7fee01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769840140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/1d191f7e63846c61db9badf27997606c43940243/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769840140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/1d191f7e63846c61db9badf27997606c43940243/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769840140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Action-RPG combat using melee weaponry, includes blood effects.\r\nBrief instances of censored/pixelated nudity. "},"demos":[{"appid":3565370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/a5f231c101bcfcc5068056dcd105de6d.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Chained is a co-op souls-lite adventure where coordination is as vital as skill. Confront your brutal, monster-fied sins, co-navigate treacherous platforms, and endure purgatory with you and your partner eternally bound by the Soul Chain.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remember - one mistake may lead you both to your doom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/116edf92ee0b0ce729f8a0b4eada9929.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re both Soul Chain-bound! </strong>Use it (and mind its physics) to control battles in creative ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrupt enemy attacks at the perfect moment; Coil up threats and punish them with chain magic; Clothesline mobs by pulling tight and moving as one; Yank your partner to safety\u2026 or doom (usually doom).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/11fbc6af6ff843836d0975ae5af9b4e6.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every swing counts. Every dodge matters. Combat is deliberate, weighty, and unforgiving - but fair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read patterns, commit to your moves, and fight like a unit. The chain adds an extra layer of risk: mistime a roll, drift too far, or fail to call out an attack\u2026 and you both pay the price. ROLL TOGETHER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/5436be4a306cc0fa9d81a98a7dad346f.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only way out is through.</strong> Jump over devious platforming challenges where one bad leap can drag both of you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chain doesn\u2019t just test your timing - it tests your trust. Learn the rhythm, communicate, and embrace the tether\u2026 or prepare for the blame when you both hit the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/1ed36f8bf0be482aed0223c0a95f3ce4.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal trials stand between you and redemption - each one a towering embodiment of your sins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These boss encounters demand true cooperation: manage distance, control the chain, and strike in unison. One mistake can snap your momentum and send you both back to suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.poster.avif?t=1769840140\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.webm?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/extras/bddd8783ff28ea03e8585a15d15c28a8.mp4?t=1769840140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo's not chaotic enough?</strong> Throw up to four players into purgatory and watch strategy unravel into glorious madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Coordination becomes a comedy of errors, clutch saves become legendary, and blame becomes a second language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kyroware Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544130/63b9a74f169b8e46d98b9baa053529dae60