acherous platforms, and endure purgatory with you and your partner eternally bound by the Soul Chain. Remember - one mistake may lead you both to your doom!","steam_appid":3544130,"support_info":{"email":"info@kyroware.com","url":"https://www.kyroware.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.kyroware.com/"}